flowchart TB
  accTitle: Deployment of the default installation
  accDescr: On the operator’s machine, `docker compose` runs the panel, the worker, the Temporal server with its web UI, and the Postgres database Temporal stores its state in. The worker starts one box per job through the Docker socket. The box calls the coding agent service; the worker reaches a remote forge, tracker and board through adapters.
  person("A person")
  subgraph host["The operator’s machine: `docker compose`"]
    panel["`panel`<br>127.0.0.1:8787"]
    worker["`worker`"]
    temporal["`temporal`, 127.0.0.1:7233<br>`temporal-ui`, 127.0.0.1:8080"]
    state[("State volume<br>registry, local<br>board, metrics")]
    box["Box<br>one container per job"]
    db[("`temporal-db`<br>Postgres 16")]
  end
  vendor["Coding agent<br>service"]
  forge["Remote forge,<br>tracker and board"]
  person -->|"browser"| panel
  person ~~~ worker
  panel -->|"signals and reads"| temporal
  worker -->|"task queue `beeverforge-jobs`"| temporal
  temporal --> db
  panel --- state
  worker --- state
  worker -->|"Docker socket"| box
  box -->|"harness calls"| vendor
  worker -->|"adapters"| forge
